Does {ro gerku be da cu gerku (zo'e)} imply {su'o de zo'u ro gerku be da=20
cu gerku de}, that is, that all dogs are of the same breed? This=20
implication should hold if {zo'e} stands for a constant*. This is a=20
perspicacious question Robin Town has raised today to me.

(* Each occurrence of {zo'e} would stand for an anonymous constant, as=20
each of its occurrences may refer to something different.)

=E2=80=94Ilmen.


